message: "If you use this research artifact, please cite the thesis and the software."
title: "Adaptive Swarm Navigation with Reinforcement Learning: Simulation Sandbox"
type: software
version: "0.5"
date-released: 2026-07-31
authors:
  - family-names: Koukousias
    given-names: Athanasios
abstract: >-
  The companion simulator for a BSc thesis on swarms that explore an unknown
  three-dimensional environment, adapt their collective behavior with
  reinforcement learning, and plan routes that balance distance and threat.
keywords:
  - swarm intelligence
  - reinforcement learning
  - boids
  - path planning
  - multi-agent systems
